{"bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapter":{"bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","chapterSlug":"ch04","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionCount":46,"questions":[{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0001","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":1,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-01.webp","x":207,"y":429,"width":1013,"height":110,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":529,"width":1160,"height":709,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列何種情形,毋需委請承銷商出具評估報告?","optionTexts":{"1":"募集設立","2":"發行交換公司債","3":"發行轉換公司債","4":"補辦公開發行"},"explanationText":"「發行人募集與發行有價證券處理準則」§6規定,發行人申報募集與發行有價證券,有下列情形之一,應分別委請主辦證券承銷商評估、律師審核相關法律事項,並依規定分別提出評估報告及法律意見書: 一、上市或上櫃公司辦理現金發行新股、合併發行新股、受讓他公司股份發行新股、依法律規定進行收購或分割發行新股者。二、興櫃股票公司辦理現金增資並提撥發行新股總額之一定比率公開銷售者。三、發行人經證券交易所向本會申報其股票創新板上市契約後,辦理現金增資發行新股為初次上市公開銷售者。四、股票未在證券交易所上市(以下簡稱未上市)或未在證券商營業處所買賣之公司辦理現金發行新股,依第十八條規定提撥發行新股總額之一定比率對外公開發行者。五、募集設立者。六、發行具股權性質之公司債有委託證券承銷商對外公開承銷者。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"1563715f2c84ed6fc729649c42090313968a4479c9d1f18acc706abd9e9c7798","explanationSegmentsSha256":"c943f953d09c18b0453333de7e089960991ae711fad820f847e2d63902043f50"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0002","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":2,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-01.webp","x":201,"y":1228,"width":1019,"height":201,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":1419,"width":1160,"height":269,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"主管機關對發行人募集發行有價證券,有下列何情事者得退回其申報案件?","optionTexts":{"1":"簽證會計師出具無保留意見","2":"承銷商出具評估報告表示發行有價證券計畫之可行性","3":"未依證券交易法規定設置薪資報酬委員會","4":"公司依法律規定進行收購或分割發行新股者"},"explanationText":"依「發行人募集與發行有價證券處理準則」§7:八、上市櫃公司或興櫃公司未依「證券交易法」§14-6第1項規定設置薪資報酬委員會或依法令規定辦理,情節重大者主管機關得退回其申報案件。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"5db31b34d6d3ce22bc873f0cab3fdcab9fe80c6a66f27f92b05656ba241e6112","explanationSegmentsSha256":"4d0377b104339d55e2f8ae9c3349aa354eb145ddd6630b5791dcdf79539176ab"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0003","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":3,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-02.webp","x":180,"y":201,"width":1040,"height":150,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":341,"width":1160,"height":155,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"上市(櫃)公司股票發行人依規定申請現金發行新股時,原則上係於金融監督管理委員會受理申報書之日起屆滿多少營業日始生效力?","optionTexts":{"1":"7個","2":"10個","3":"12 個","4":"15個"},"explanationText":"依「發行人募集與發行有價證券處理準則」§13第2項規定, 除依第1項提出申報者外,於金管會及金管會指定之機構收到發行新股申報書即日起屆滿12個營業日生效。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"1a6ea265d62a09edf7c33c1d1bb96d4c7b8bf80bf836ac46ad27b3970e930d30","explanationSegmentsSha256":"2264f3ee9cc4c0aef0adb8c35c52f9ff94a6f589b5809f19d19f983113c5462f"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0004","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":4,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-02.webp","x":176,"y":486,"width":1044,"height":157,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":633,"width":1160,"height":198,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"非金融控股、銀行、票券金融、信用卡及保險事業,如辦理現金增資發行新股且為初次上市、上櫃公開銷售者,可縮短申報生效為幾個營業日?","optionTexts":{"1":"3個","2":"5個","3":"7個","4":"12個"},"explanationText":"依「發行人募集與發行有價證券處理準則」§13第2項規定, 金融控股、銀行、票券金融、信用卡及保險等事業以外之發行人,辦理現金增資發行新股為初次上市、上櫃公開銷售者,申報生效期間縮短為7個營業日。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"1ada575bed155e7cc14111857d81e4bdae113824f190dc4793e7b2b36d22ad6e","explanationSegmentsSha256":"7651c704edf5ca1f49e8539c95ce5e0fd051a1e1fa262b0c9f8f51bd2ff1e9e9"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0005","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":5,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-02.webp","x":175,"y":821,"width":1045,"height":111,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":922,"width":1160,"height":152,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"創新板上市公司依上市審查準則之規定,辦理現金增資發行新股者,申報生效為幾個營業日?","optionTexts":{"1":"15個","2":"12個","3":"7個","4":"5個"},"explanationText":"依「發行人募集與發行有價證券處理準則」§13第2項規定, 創新板上市公司申請改列為上市審查準則第二章規定之公司辦理現金增資發行新股者,申報生效期間縮短為7個營業日。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"8ed992331ce2fb193606c05718dd3f8b865102e27585f1442c8b8ac942d7a9e9","explanationSegmentsSha256":"f98efdf83ffc9b71d779f199f7ce9b92ec87b233b43b09a0dfbb6f1dc966c720"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0006","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":6,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-02.webp","x":176,"y":1064,"width":1044,"height":199,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":1253,"width":1160,"height":108,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"有關募集發行有價證券,承銷商出具評估報告並編製工作底稿,以下何者有誤?","optionTexts":{"1":"工作底稿應求完整並加目錄索引","2":"應明確紀載已實施之評估程序","3":"僅複核督導人員須在工作底稿簽名","4":"應納入所達成的結論"},"explanationText":"依「發行人募集與發行有價證券承銷商評估報告應行記載事項要點」貳規定。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"c3c02ff3fc063246298fedeebee8dc0648d32b20787d2bbb64f817212f658473","explanationSegmentsSha256":"2ba73e1850548baaeab56752ec005cda1faca220a8ed46f1e4f102a99f918b06"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0007","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":7,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-02.webp","x":178,"y":1351,"width":1042,"height":107,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":1448,"width":1160,"height":109,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"募集發行有價證券,承銷商出具評估報告所編製之工作底稿,至少應保存幾年?","optionTexts":{"1":"一年","2":"三年","3":"五年","4":"無限期"},"explanationText":"依「發行人募集與發行有價證券承銷商評估報告應行記載事項要點」貳規定,工作底稿應保存五年,以供查考。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"09d650d12ce4a8663bff01310e536dec5363b0be8f16679d1cfce2f3c5930306","explanationSegmentsSha256":"a7e7213ed01e62a58d104642f3e2ef0be4ed124a5cffccc50095ec001d3f2306"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0008","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":8,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-02.webp","x":181,"y":1547,"width":1039,"height":100,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-03.webp","x":181,"y":195,"width":1039,"height":110,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":295,"width":1160,"height":111,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券承銷商承銷現金增資發行新股,承銷商之售價與原股東認購價格","optionTexts":{"1":"不得差超過2%","2":"不得差超過3%","3":"不得差超過5%","4":"應相同"},"explanationText":"依「證券交易法」§28-1第4項規定,承銷商承銷現金增資發行新股時,原股東認購之價格應與對外公開發行之價格相同。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"552bc36a6664054d20cf7c02b6578091c0e63f96db474f0f9afcabd8d8c1c31a","explanationSegmentsSha256":"bc8897cea3aa509238478c14a4bcf06649d3b3e0c34363e75959a84f4f75497d"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0009","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":9,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-03.webp","x":187,"y":396,"width":1033,"height":110,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":496,"width":1160,"height":382,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"依據證券交易法規定,證券承銷方式不包含下列哪一種型態?","optionTexts":{"1":"全額包銷","2":"代銷","3":"居間銷售","4":"餘額包銷"},"explanationText":"有價證券之包銷:依「證券交易法」§71之規定,證券承銷商包銷有價證券,於承銷契約所訂定之承銷期間屆滿後,對於約定包銷之有價證券,未能全數銷售者,其騰餘數額之有價證券,應自行認購之。證券承銷商包銷有價證券,得先行認購後再行銷售或於承銷契約訂明保留一部分自行認購。有價證券之代銷:依§72之規定,證券承銷商代銷有價證券,於承銷契約所訂定之承銷期間屆滿後,對於約定代銷之有價證券,未能全數銷售者,其騰餘數額之有價證券,得退還發行人。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"430cfd9d1f5a4ffcd93b2c039949a1159c8ad7936c99ae871687651fb4e3fb47","explanationSegmentsSha256":"0a84f2ca491af135f215a389fbfafbea1a62edf65db22c2f84a4b9dbd0fd5ffe"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0010","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":10,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-03.webp","x":180,"y":868,"width":1040,"height":156,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":1014,"width":1160,"height":158,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券商代銷有價證券,於承銷期間屆滿後,未能全數出售者,其剩餘數額之證券,得","optionTexts":{"1":"繼續銷售","2":"洽商特定人認購","3":"退還主辦承銷商","4":"退還發行人"},"explanationText":"依「證券交易法」§72規定,證券商代銷有價證券,於承銷期間屆滿後,未能全數出售者,其剩餘數額之證券,證券商得退還證券發行人。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"9485e19d6ae107f7b503d3553dd99b7c3238d2ab878b0db08159b973bc4d8916","explanationSegmentsSha256":"ffb8c625abb022ea9c44d37b0e217a33b174c50973129decd8b75ac457cc2482"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0011","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":11,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-03.webp","x":178,"y":1162,"width":1042,"height":110,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":1262,"width":1160,"height":113,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"以下何者非普通股之基本特性?","optionTexts":{"1":"表彰公司之所有權","2":"無限清償責任","3":"投票權","4":"盈餘分配"},"explanationText":"普通股之特性:表彰公司之所有權,負有限清償責任,有投票權、享盈餘分配,具優先認股權。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"07c68c8970d9ab0c9590691c7b84cf9779ab1ea60afd438ff76ede8463597f1d","explanationSegmentsSha256":"f7c8fbf7825c5e040c7ea9af14d3507f1369f1e0417d958d331a046fef77375b"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0012","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":12,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-03.webp","x":176,"y":1365,"width":1044,"height":153,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":1508,"width":1160,"height":180,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":246,"width":1160,"height":75,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"以下何者非證券商辦理有價證券承銷時決定承銷價格之方式?","optionTexts":{"1":"競價拍賣","2":"詢價圈購","3":"與發行機構議定","4":"按消息發布日前五日之平均收盤價"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§4第1項規定,證券承銷商辦理有價證券之承銷,其承銷價格以左列方式之一為之: 券持有人議定。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"7ad6bf9442940c7795c268b4ef56d01b21155819219c3112fc38b2887bc3191f","explanationSegmentsSha256":"56028eababe835a8654115c674adcd6300a0f337437ce9e692bde574d6e63fb0"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0013","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":13,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-04.webp","x":192,"y":311,"width":1028,"height":201,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":502,"width":1160,"height":245,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"未經登錄興櫃交易之初次上市、櫃案件,承銷商辦理對外公開銷售時應先保留普通股一千股由以下何機構認購?","optionTexts":{"1":"證券暨期貨市場發展基金會","2":"證券投資人及期貨交易人保護中心","3":"證券商業同業公會","4":"金融法制暨犯罪防制中心"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§4-1第4項規定, 未經登錄興櫃交易之初次上市(櫃)案件、臺灣存託憑證初次發行之承銷案件,證券承銷商辦理對外公開銷售時,應先行保留承銷之普通股股份一千股(存託憑證一千單位),供財團法人證券投資人及期貨交易人保護中心認購。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"1a19765fd14818db7a396acb3294a919a1343eacf4fc59e84f225b5ce5584e3c","explanationSegmentsSha256":"1bb12f224517cdbcd18ad67c3177a95040c5c1b6e0c9c5a80d0f08e91aa074e7"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0014","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":14,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-04.webp","x":178,"y":737,"width":1042,"height":112,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":839,"width":1160,"height":107,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"以下何者為股票現行的承銷(對外公開銷售)之配售方式?","optionTexts":{"1":"公開申購配售","2":"競價拍賣","3":"詢價圈購","4":"選項(1)(2)(3)皆是"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§5規定,現行配售方式有競價拍賣、詢價圈購、公開申購配售及洽商銷售四種。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"9ed32583cc95dac9774b67700e6bc78b8a38a3920936fefb33708925806b5b49","explanationSegmentsSha256":"dc5190a19c7b8b1fe181cd717b547c944291aab51e334935222f795bb95c43eb"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0015","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":15,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-04.webp","x":176,"y":936,"width":1044,"height":153,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":1079,"width":1160,"height":110,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"承銷商參與競價拍賣,其投標保證金應以投標金額多少為最高限制?","optionTexts":{"1":"不高於投標保證金額20%","2":"不高於投標保證金額 50%","3":"不高於投標保證金額60%","4":"不高於投標保證金額100%"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§9第4項規定,投標保證金應以投標金額之30%~60%為限。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"a631f3015b7387240e4ea0b8438b849877caf6cf5404d24d94de219d85f90129","explanationSegmentsSha256":"a0dc400a8d5e8da4730e5ae70df898a02e0fe373f96d09d1a147ecac01baed6a"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0016","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":16,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-04.webp","x":175,"y":1179,"width":1045,"height":152,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":1321,"width":1160,"height":113,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"初次上市櫃承銷案件如採競價拍賣方式辦理時,原則上每一得標人最高得標數量不得超過該次對外公開銷售部分之百分之幾?","optionTexts":{"1":"1%","2":"5%","3":"10%","4":"無限制"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§9第5項規定,每一得標人得標數量不得逾該次對外公開銷售部份之10%。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"e36cd86c3d35e644fa4ca674239f26393b641a904e8e891e572dcbaa71aa5931","explanationSegmentsSha256":"e491d2fa7312a09032fc477cc4c5fec0950b9e0e1e8862d6c349b41a9a646f48"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0017","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":17,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-04.webp","x":177,"y":1424,"width":1043,"height":109,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":1523,"width":1160,"height":122,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"參與競價拍賣每一得標人最高得標數量,不得超過該次承銷總數","optionTexts":{"1":"3%","2":"5%","3":"10%","4":"15%"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§9第5項規定,每一得標人得標數量不得逾該次對外公開銷售部份之10%。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"e504a63926dcdac0fe2edafe278cfd0af642337da7248566891b90cf4e4a1be3","explanationSegmentsSha256":"cd858ae771aa7db94741130a4cc22e6556dfdf2911be03f245977c1bb667170d"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0018","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":18,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-05.webp","x":174,"y":188,"width":1046,"height":159,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-05.webp","x":60,"y":337,"width":1160,"height":163,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券承銷商以競價拍賣配售辦理承銷,應於期限內辦理有關投標、競標事項,第幾天為接受投標截止日?","optionTexts":{"1":"第二天","2":"第三天","3":"第四天","4":"第五天"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§11規定,證券承銷商採全數競價拍賣配售辦理承銷,應於期限內辦理有關投標、競標事項,第一天為接受投標開始日,第三天為接受投標截止日。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"eaab7e867f45502a405e265e0c5085fe8b2bf07da05c179095d5bcd7268dcb15","explanationSegmentsSha256":"262acfc7357b56cd52b79a17b9e954058e68c683262eb40dec4cd5fddccb3898"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0019","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":19,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-05.webp","x":171,"y":490,"width":1049,"height":114,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-05.webp","x":60,"y":594,"width":1160,"height":117,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券承銷商以競價拍賣配售辦理承銷,第幾天為開標日?","optionTexts":{"1":"第二天","2":"第三天","3":"第四天","4":"第五天"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§11第1項第4款規定,第五天為開標日。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"edd4a2d721e266a3adf2cae09138e2fd4eb065356665b9c17784512c11c2de04","explanationSegmentsSha256":"675570c4983a27f337bbc0955c8c1eb782ed950a3619665e670dc546d5dbebcc"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0020","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":20,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-05.webp","x":168,"y":701,"width":1052,"height":210,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-05.webp","x":60,"y":901,"width":1160,"height":112,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"有價證券採競價拍賣方式承銷時,下列敘述何者為不正確?","optionTexts":{"1":"投標人應依規定繳交投標保證金","2":"已投標之標單得撤回","3":"透過網際網路送至「有價證券競價拍賣系統」進行投標","4":"證券承銷商得向投標人收取投標處理費"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§12第3項規定, 投標人投標後投標單不得撤回或更改。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"30cda18b671b043bec5ce7c24946541a8751c86d0672968990e3a4b5cb99c30f","explanationSegmentsSha256":"7c9e4601533d669b1d091166b6df1e6dfaf6fb988268c13a28a21fd074dcc511"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0021","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":21,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-05.webp","x":167,"y":1003,"width":1053,"height":114,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-05.webp","x":60,"y":1107,"width":1160,"height":155,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"詢價圈購如何決定誰得標?","optionTexts":{"1":"最高價得標","2":"數量最多者","3":"圈購送交承銷商時間較快者","4":"依實際承銷價格及認購數量為承諾者"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§29第2項規定, 詢價圈購之投資人於主辦承銷商所定期限內,就實際承銷價格及認購數量為承諾者即成立交易,並應於期限內繳款。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"4475a6901be74d1fc33e3a375d9177805538c259352962adcb0a9c0e960f3b79","explanationSegmentsSha256":"b419cfba572c61798be42df022c317e35beed60ac1952a5bdb3d257b80f93c4e"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0022","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":22,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-05.webp","x":167,"y":1252,"width":1053,"height":250,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-05.webp","x":60,"y":1492,"width":1160,"height":196,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-06.webp","x":60,"y":149,"width":1160,"height":122,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券承銷商辦理有價證券之承銷,其配售方式有:競價拍賣、詢價圈購、公開申購配售、洽商銷售四種。其中募集普通公司債、未涉及股權之金融債券、不動產資產信託受益憑證等承銷案件,得全數或部分採行何種方式銷售?","optionTexts":{"1":"競價拍賣","2":"詢價圈購","3":"洽商銷售","4":"公開配售申購"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§31第1項規定，募集普通公司債、未涉及股權之金融債券、分離型附認股權公司債其分離後之公司債、不動產資產信託受益證券、受託機構公開招募受益證券或特殊目的公司公開招募資產基礎證券之承銷案件，得全數或部分採洽商銷售方式辦理，並依§30規定訂定承銷價格。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"5916a3161f6c97da9b3aafa656ec6412ad51a018bd69d7b4eacf8b335e7cfd56","explanationSegmentsSha256":"0ae81fa4826474164c3102f4967d1049952bcdd8f0dde5a06e3ebc782c3e5044"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0023","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":23,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-06.webp","x":183,"y":261,"width":1037,"height":115,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-06.webp","x":60,"y":366,"width":1160,"height":163,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列何種有價證券的發行一定要洽商銷售方式辦理承銷?","optionTexts":{"1":"股票","2":"認購權證","3":"可轉換公司債","4":"普通公司債"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§31第2項規定, 發行認購(售)權證、指數投資證券之承銷案件應全數採洽商銷售方式辦理。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"a7ac65b6321d4c3793b8fbae76aaef980e0162231acc36202e424862dc7738e2","explanationSegmentsSha256":"df9c4a4cd8b8e99cded230d0fcd2db2bfbc60436d44133171f4cb395ecbd9a97"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0024","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":24,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-06.webp","x":168,"y":519,"width":1052,"height":162,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-06.webp","x":60,"y":671,"width":1160,"height":212,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"採洽商銷售之承銷案件,除經主管機關核准者外,指數投資證券案件,每一認購人認購數量不得超過該項承銷總數之百分之幾?","optionTexts":{"1":"5%","2":"10%","3":"15%","4":"20%"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§32第1項規定, 採洽商銷售之承銷案件,除經證券主管機關核准者外,每一認購人認購數量規定如下:四.認購(售)權證、指數投資證券、附認股權公司債案件每一認購人認購數量不得超過該次承銷總數之10%。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"23eea288f63abecd3865c3a37bc640db05e841ab5621c5df4e54d05d9b6b47f7","explanationSegmentsSha256":"54e49ec4857b08798154b5121325cf36206622354762c2f153207d0ccbd00898"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0025","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":25,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-06.webp","x":165,"y":873,"width":1055,"height":164,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-06.webp","x":60,"y":1027,"width":1160,"height":215,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"採洽商銷售承銷之認購(售)權證、指數投資證券、附認股權公司債案件每一認購人認購數量不得超過該次承銷總數之","optionTexts":{"1":"5%","2":"10%","3":"20%","4":"30%"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§32第1項規定, 採洽商銷售之承銷案件,除經證券主管機關核准者外,每一認購人認購數量規定如下:四、認購(售)權證、指數投資證券、附認股權公司債案件每一認購人認購數量不得超過該次承銷總數之10%。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"6bb53edea6f97825d50d2925da89465674c6624dd8da848741ef9e99473f072a","explanationSegmentsSha256":"1c5b7edf5b4649f9ad89258121a4f830b18d5811cbce54b579b016b61620a87c"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0026","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":26,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-06.webp","x":164,"y":1232,"width":1056,"height":164,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-06.webp","x":60,"y":1386,"width":1160,"height":277,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"採洽商銷售之承銷案件,除經主管機關核准者外,普通公司債案件每一認購人認購數量不得超過該次承銷總數之百分之幾?","optionTexts":{"1":"10%","2":"30%","3":"50%","4":"100%"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§32第1項規定, 採洽商銷售之承銷案件,除經證券主管機關核准者外,每一認購人認購數量規定如下:一、普通公司債、未涉及股權之金融債券每一認購人認購數量不得超過該次承銷總數之50%,惟認購人為保險公司且認購做為投資型保險商品所連結投資標的者不在此限。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"939ed90ea610646bb20dbd93469907ab9f24d30e026d454a4f84408855977a64","explanationSegmentsSha256":"2b98f02be91b89eab3401290f0752006629032a83f92e0d08daaed796ffdbdd2"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0027","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":27,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-07.webp","x":176,"y":165,"width":1044,"height":112,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-07.webp","x":60,"y":267,"width":1160,"height":71,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"採洽商銷售承銷之普通公司債案件,原則上每一認購人所認購數量不得超過該次承銷總數之","optionTexts":{"1":"10%","2":"20%","3":"30%","4":"50%"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§32第1項規定, 採洽商銷售之承銷案件,除經證券主管機關核准者外,每一認購人認購數量規定如下:一、普通公司債、未涉及股權之金融債券每一認購人認購數量不得超過該次承銷總數之50%,惟認購人為保險公司且認購做為投資型保險商品所連結投資標的者不在此限。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"6ecc0db923e081ac08e6613d180ece7c4500e1ac5459b4ef0c987f22279c3f55","explanationSegmentsSha256":"f1bddd70a2c4e87932175190f033cc5b9c50e02dfbc838afce72c8d95aafa02b"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0028","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":28,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-07.webp","x":175,"y":328,"width":1045,"height":161,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-07.webp","x":60,"y":479,"width":1160,"height":116,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列何者不得參與競價拍賣之投標?","optionTexts":{"1":"成年之中華民國國民","2":"發行公司直屬總經理之部門主管","3":"本國法人募集之證券投資信託基金","4":"外國專業投資機構"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§35規定,證券承銷商受理競價拍賣投標之對象,選項(1)(3)(4)皆可。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"925dae36ebb464c891e7e42a9aa13fb0a2d6f663f6171115bfed3a5a5e40a41f","explanationSegmentsSha256":"a031905895853c185e63d337aa26c65a428b3231bd62a79bbfa493de0beb5b81"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0029","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":29,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-07.webp","x":171,"y":585,"width":1049,"height":161,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-07.webp","x":60,"y":736,"width":1160,"height":164,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"以詢價圈購方式辦理現金增資承銷案者,圈購人遞交圈購單時,證券承銷商得向圈購人收取所圈購金額之多少百分比以下作為圈購保證金?","optionTexts":{"1":"5%","2":"10%","3":"15%","4":"20%"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§40第6項規定, 以詢價圈購方式辦理現金增資承銷案者,圈購人遞交圈購單時,證券承銷商得向圈購人收取所圈購金額之20%以下之圈購保證金。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"e92715dd148d1e114eaba486f0804bd03e00c031770dab15492d6a32b0e9e9e5","explanationSegmentsSha256":"50b3bf7d6c1eb8ddb76ce144be59dfb8ac7e29f3cf3dce81819b48f2080a698e"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0030","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":30,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-07.webp","x":174,"y":890,"width":1046,"height":209,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-07.webp","x":60,"y":1089,"width":1160,"height":166,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券商辦理初次上市、上櫃承銷案件,受理詢價圈購之對象,如有下列何者參與詢價圈購,應拒絕之?","optionTexts":{"1":"發行公司之員工","2":"承銷商本身之董事、監察人","3":"發行公司之董事長或總經理","4":"選項 (1)(2)(3)皆應拒絕"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§43-1第1項規定, 證券承銷商受理詢價圈購之對象,如有所列18款之人參與詢價圈購,應拒絕之。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"96b14b2dee76dc36f1898208b7c173617ad9cbdfa935abb176c92206f156ef64","explanationSegmentsSha256":"b950ae3935c5a530c014a6b194c872058305b36e015119e73bb776719223f6dd"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0031","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":31,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-07.webp","x":172,"y":1245,"width":1048,"height":112,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-07.webp","x":60,"y":1347,"width":1160,"height":167,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券經紀商辦理公開申購配售所收之每件處理費為新臺幣多少元?","optionTexts":{"1":"0元","2":"20元","3":"10元","4":"各經紀商自訂價格"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§56規定,申購人就每一種有價證券之公開申購僅能選擇一家經紀商辦理申購,不得重複申購,且每一申購人限申購一銷售單位,每件處理費新臺幣20元。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"3d447543f65bc70a047358dc4fa0596c743e9d5436a323d922e8eb9b3471bf12","explanationSegmentsSha256":"816858afe1fa519ca2f4bcccdfbc377014ff5b2d5ba219a7430284da9d79f721"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0032","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":32,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-07.webp","x":173,"y":1504,"width":1047,"height":157,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-07.webp","x":60,"y":1651,"width":1160,"height":37,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-08.webp","x":60,"y":189,"width":1160,"height":117,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"公開申購配售案件之申購人就每一種有價證券之公開申購能選擇幾家經紀商辦理申購?","optionTexts":{"1":"一家","2":"三家","3":"五家","4":"沒有限制"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§56規定，申購人就每一種有價證券之公開申購僅能選擇一家經紀商辦理申購，不得重複申購，且每一申購人限申購一銷售單位，每件處理費新臺幣20元。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"6e220f37f91b1043c09b5680255f9c425e44d158e768b40e365598a157586918","explanationSegmentsSha256":"b8ea25b2b9ac65ba6db41c24a7a06980c57b64d988bed2f5e6a4cdfaf313a132"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0033","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":33,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-08.webp","x":243,"y":296,"width":977,"height":108,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-08.webp","x":60,"y":394,"width":1160,"height":67,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"公開申購配售制度，假設有一投資人擬申購以三張為一配售單位，每一配售單位承銷價60元之上市股票，請問其最多申購張數？","optionTexts":{"1":"一張","2":"二張","3":"三張","4":"沒有限制"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§56規定,申購人就每一種有價證券之公開申購僅能選擇一家經紀商辦理申購,不得重複申購,且每一申購人限申購一銷售單位,每件處理費新臺幣20元。 本題一銷售單位為三張。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"85fc400a223bd2213523fb757aa082dbae4bed3168cde95673f01291807c8f87","explanationSegmentsSha256":"76a6bd17a18621c3e0ab8183fc12dfd73805c635c6ce8c88f515a2fd18a4d2ea"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0034","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":34,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-08.webp","x":172,"y":451,"width":1048,"height":203,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-08.webp","x":60,"y":644,"width":1160,"height":159,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"辦理公開申購配售之案件,申購人有下列何種情況,則經紀商不得接受其受託申購?","optionTexts":{"1":"利用或冒用他人名義申購者","2":"申購委託書應填寫之各項資料未經填妥或資料不實者","3":"未於所委託申購之經紀商開立交易戶","4":"選項(1)(2)(3)皆是"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§58規定,申購人有所列各款情事之一者,經紀商不得受託申購,已受理者應予剔除; 共計七款。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"1349caaee9a8ff8e843db9c2efa5237924d1093426017619151984854f1b54bb","explanationSegmentsSha256":"ebc16c1d4088e0be04fee285f796b2ca2cffdf46718743711b7a875302a23eab"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0035","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":35,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-08.webp","x":169,"y":793,"width":1051,"height":156,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-08.webp","x":60,"y":939,"width":1160,"height":115,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"股票承銷公開抽籤之電腦作業,由下列哪一機構負責?","optionTexts":{"1":"證券商業同業公會","2":"臺灣證券交易所","3":"集保結算所","4":"金融監督管理委員會"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§60規定,股票承銷公開抽籤之電腦作業,由臺灣證券交易所辦理。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"de3bef02f0701b37dbbe28adcca6cc356add45a3a35ad83ba91b8c1b6d197177","explanationSegmentsSha256":"688684a35f565e52d17509329a986524aa292d0f6a790673dca3995f6b4a9bcf"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0036","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":36,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-08.webp","x":166,"y":1044,"width":1054,"height":249,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-08.webp","x":60,"y":1283,"width":1160,"height":250,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"公開申購配售之包銷案件,除其他法令另有禁止規定或屬未上市 (櫃)承銷案件者,承銷團就申購數量未達銷售數量之差額部分及中籤人認購不足之部分,其總計若未超過該次提出公開申購配售總數多少時,應由承銷團全數自行認購?","optionTexts":{"1":"5%","2":"10%","3":"15%","4":"沒有限制"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§61規定,公開申購配售之包銷案件,承銷團就申購數量未達銷售數量之差額部分得由承銷團洽特定人認購或承銷團自行認購。前項承銷團自行認購部分, 其他法令另有禁止規定者,或屬未上市(櫃)承銷案件者,得不適用前項自行認購之規定,並由承銷團洽特定人認購之。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"665865bb2f7349721322fae0cdfb0e986d1e822744723f495efa90fd3bd8ba31","explanationSegmentsSha256":"ab66f7192e07518336832bbb09f5384865403918114c96a96f765172bbc1598b"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0037","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":37,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-08.webp","x":167,"y":1523,"width":1053,"height":118,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-09.webp","x":167,"y":161,"width":1053,"height":162,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-09.webp","x":60,"y":313,"width":1160,"height":216,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"以已發行股票辦理初次上市或初次上櫃之公開申購配售承銷案件, 完成認購人申購、預扣價款及中籤通知等事宜後,於第幾天為辦理股票掛牌上市或上櫃公告?","optionTexts":{"1":"第二天","2":"第五天","3":"第十天","4":"第十五天"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§63第1項第4款規定,以已發行股票辦理初次上市或初次上櫃之公開申購配售承銷案件,依§53第1項規定完成認購人申購、預扣價款及中籤通知等事宜後,於第十天辦理股票掛牌上市或上櫃公告。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"d31f8448106a6a42bca483e5c4d0856a62891603f215c58bc81cbb5650b2110e","explanationSegmentsSha256":"b28d695ee28a83a1d21676c21c03e22ba2f4758fdab5e5fb29b7be8aa5894aaf"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0038","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":38,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-09.webp","x":176,"y":519,"width":1044,"height":110,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-09.webp","x":60,"y":619,"width":1160,"height":118,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券承銷商以洽商銷售辦理承銷,應於認購人認購前交付下列何項文件?","optionTexts":{"1":"評估報告","2":"財務報告","3":"公開說明書","4":"年報"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§74規定,證券承銷商以洽商銷售辦理承銷,應於認購人認購前交付公開說明書。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"c6aa18779d92e6b564b8868d20b530e235fbf1fe798e28625305fc62da2fdd7c","explanationSegmentsSha256":"ba87dd462d613cc9d11cc06c2d9a6f5c49e54c52f6616d8b0d04019892fe6e57"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0039","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":39,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-09.webp","x":175,"y":727,"width":1045,"height":160,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-09.webp","x":60,"y":877,"width":1160,"height":160,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"現行公開申購配售制度,於何時進行電腦抽籤?","optionTexts":{"1":"申購截止日次一營業日","2":"申購截止日次二營業日","3":"申購截止日次三營業日","4":"申購截止日次四營業日"},"explanationText":"依「證券商辦理公開申購配售作業處理程序」參第2項規定, 辦理公開抽籤:證交所應於申購截止日後次二營業日上午九時邀集相關單位共同監督,完成合格件之電腦抽籤。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"188a4fed68ef786d8a8695589939b58bea94ea7b03927badb561657c17b35957","explanationSegmentsSha256":"d8feec79bf04d1b643002c58dff1650d2d990e4dca1cc47262e3cfa6ae26e3eb"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0040","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":40,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-09.webp","x":175,"y":1027,"width":1045,"height":159,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-09.webp","x":60,"y":1176,"width":1160,"height":163,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"股票初次上市(櫃)之承銷案件,發行公司採行過額配售辦理承銷作業者,主辦承銷商應於該案件掛牌之日起幾個交易日內,執行穩定價格之機制?","optionTexts":{"1":"三日","2":"五日","3":"七日","4":"十日"},"explanationText":"依「承銷商辦理初次上市(櫃)案件承銷作業應行注意事項要點」§7規定,初次上市(櫃)案件採過額配售者,主辦承銷商於掛牌日起第五個交易日內,進行穩定價格操作。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"bb9eb5dd20e7a2843827d7994648946d4d082ba61dc218df7918836453077f4d","explanationSegmentsSha256":"6e6a9e5d2a9f2f666d21d73bb5e3a1cb4ede6bb2f26cd7a5f554f66cf88dfecb"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0041","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":41,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-09.webp","x":176,"y":1329,"width":1044,"height":157,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-09.webp","x":60,"y":1476,"width":1160,"height":114,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"現行公開申購有價證券制度,投資人應向下列何者洽辦委託事宜?","optionTexts":{"1":"證券經紀商","2":"證券自營商","3":"證券承銷商","4":"證券商業同業公會"},"explanationText":"依「承銷或再行銷售有價證券處理辦法」§56規定,申購人就每一種有價證券之公開申購僅能選擇一家經紀商辦理申購。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"eb676923a7e0d3133ab82659052ba3e932837ace2f06f6a5993eedc02a7fd642","explanationSegmentsSha256":"1d56be7628f67835b23016e625cb91a42140905b9c00aea10d926db7092a1aa4"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0042","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":42,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-09.webp","x":181,"y":1580,"width":1039,"height":108,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-10.webp","x":181,"y":186,"width":1039,"height":117,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-10.webp","x":60,"y":293,"width":1160,"height":202,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"引進詢價圈購及競價拍賣之配售方式,其功能為何?","optionTexts":{"1":"提高法人參與初級市場比重","2":"發揮承銷商配售功能","3":"使資金募集更具效益","4":"選項(1)(2)(3)皆是"},"explanationText":"詢價圈購及競價拍賣之配售方式,其改進精神主要在於使承銷價格更具市場性,縮短投資人繳款至可交易時間以降低投資風險, 提高法人參與初級市場比重,發揮承銷商配售之功能,使資金募集更具效益。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"5813faee80ed2acce4ea023df28f69bb7171e89ae69c5a678ec28b90c8a38b28","explanationSegmentsSha256":"ac40db815755548fe667b55c701eebc35dd3f4167f8e8dd29dbe7089416712de"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0043","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":43,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-10.webp","x":149,"y":485,"width":1071,"height":208,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-10.webp","x":60,"y":683,"width":1160,"height":345,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"依公司法規定,發行人募集發行有價證券,有下列何情事者不得公開發行新股(包括具有優先權利之特別股)?","optionTexts":{"1":"公司連2 年虧損","2":"資產不足抵償債務者","3":"最近三年稅後淨利不足以支付已發行特別股股息","4":"選項(1)(2)(3)皆是"},"explanationText":"依「公司法」§269規定之情形,不得公開發行具有優先權利之特別股:一、最近三年或開業不及三年之開業年度課稅後之平均淨利,不足支付已發行及擬發行之特別股股息者。二、對於已發行之特別股約定股息,未能按期支付者。依「公司法」§270規定之情形, 不得公開發行新股:一、連2年虧損。但依其事業性質,須有較長準備期間或具有健全之營業計畫,確能改善營利能力者,不在此限。二、資產不足抵償債務者。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"cd1d9a43c9b18c28e67c7e846c039e87b5b213bbc2a12a99c96c311f67847bcd","explanationSegmentsSha256":"f50b65e0a8534f7c7e45fd4ab57660a2d0494e9e66f9c66e1f0f851968c701a0"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0044","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":44,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-10.webp","x":149,"y":1018,"width":1071,"height":157,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-10.webp","x":60,"y":1165,"width":1160,"height":345,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"已在創新板上市買賣而申請上櫃者,一般應至少提出申請書件所載已發行股份總數之委託推薦證券商辦理上櫃前公開銷售。","optionTexts":{"1":"3%","2":"5%","3":"7%","4":"10%"},"explanationText":"依櫃買中心「證券商營業處所買賣有價證券審查準則」§4-1 第2項規定,申請公司股票已依臺灣證券交易所有價證券上市審查準則第四章規定於創新板上市買賣而申請上櫃者,應至少提出申請書件所載已發行股份總數之百分之三委託推薦證券商辦理上櫃前公開銷售,且加計創新板上市前公開銷售之股數合計應達擬上櫃股份總數之百分之十以上,如應提出之股數超過三百萬股者,得以不低於三百萬股之股數辦理公開銷售,不受前條第一項比率之限制。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"82a5247edea10a3b1f7a04e7674ef8e17a38e204a752038ae57701b9f682f71b","explanationSegmentsSha256":"cc576dcf220f603d0e2d335cde849930b4b71280ce2c7e1681b6f78d6c9c24b6"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0045","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":45,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-10.webp","x":152,"y":1500,"width":1068,"height":164,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":11,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-11.webp","x":152,"y":157,"width":1068,"height":120,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":11,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-11.webp","x":60,"y":267,"width":1160,"height":70,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"已在創新板上市買賣而申請上櫃者,一般應至少提出申請書件所載已發行股份總數之委託推薦證券商辦理上櫃前公開銷售,且加計創新板上市前公開銷售之股數,合計應達擬上櫃股份總數","optionTexts":{"1":"3%、5%","2":"3%、10%","3":"5%、10%","4":"7%、10%"},"explanationText":"依櫃買中心「證券商營業處所買賣有價證券審查準則」§4-1 第2項規定,申請公司股票已依臺灣證券交易所有價證券上市審查準則第四章規定於創新板上市買賣而申請上櫃者,應至少提出申請書件所載已發行股份總數之百分之三委託推薦證券商辦理上櫃前公開銷售,且加計創新板上市前公開銷售之股數合計應達擬上櫃股份總數之百分之十以上,如應提出之股數超過三百萬股者,得以不低於三百萬股之股數辦理公開銷售,不受前條第一項比率之限制。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"6f0b4d3945bec121c4a9a38f3caf90c4bac89be9e0a39d4ffce6b01b4d44b68f","explanationSegmentsSha256":"c1594a7512e60b3732490758485a6f91ff1a02684c2cd1d6fb8b01d25b2c4088"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch04-pdf-0046","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第四章","chapterTitle":"第四章","number":46,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第四章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":11,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-11.webp","x":172,"y":327,"width":1048,"height":209,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":11,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch04/page-11.webp","x":60,"y":526,"width":1160,"height":269,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"某公司於申請創新板上市時,已將創新板上市股份總數10%辦理公開銷售,如後續申請上櫃也符合股權分散標準,應再提出擬上櫃股份總數公開銷售。","optionTexts":{"1":"1%","2":"3%","3":"10%","4":"得免提出公開銷售"},"explanationText":"依櫃買中心「證券商營業處所買賣有價證券審查準則」§4-1 第3項規定,申請公司於申請創新板上市時已提出擬創新板上市股份總數之百分之十以上辦理公開銷售,且於申請上櫃時符合第三條第一項第三款股權分散標準者,得免依前項規定辦理公開銷售。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"71d68aa2746cedc2a0fedece93fe4e061b34d1fbf37457d895e6dbf3c258ef73","explanationSegmentsSha256":"ac177be51c6ad9082b3a4d9c530b0d3a95fb4617d74bd5caba0ac85eb6c658ae"}}]}}
